  "hints": [
    "Think about the very last move: it was either 1 step or 2 steps.",
    "So ways(n) = ways(n - 1) + ways(n - 2). Plain recursion repeats work, so remember results.",
    "Loop upwards keeping only the last two values: a, b = 1, 1; repeat n times: a, b = b, a + b; return a."
